		{
			title = "{npc:14725}, the cloth quartermaster",
			note = "{npc:14725} takes cloth for {faction:69}; he stands in the {area:1659}, in the north-east of {faction:69}, by the tailors. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7801} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House in the {area:1662} is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do {zone:1438} (levels 1-12), {zone:1439} (11-20) and {zone:1440} (18-30) while you level through them. After the donations come {quest:4183} in the {zone:1428} and {item:11040}, a second repeatable turn-in; then the optional hubs, best rate first: {area:188} (about 35 a minute at full value), {area:186} (28), {area:442} (23). Every {faction:69} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.",
